{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-99","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：截差无理线段与中项无理线段与平方","englishTitle":"The square on a second apotome of a medial straight line applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth a third apotome.","book":10,"number":99,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.99","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.99/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":99,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","contentId":"euclid-10-99","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"09f69d540c778e71fcd64774fce7f829154b53b01e7ae28f147e6836ecfe0247","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-99.statement","euclid-10-99.construction.1","euclid-10-99.construction.2","euclid-10-99.construction.3","euclid-10-99.proof.1","euclid-10-99.proof.2","euclid-10-99.construction.4","euclid-10-99.proof.3","euclid-10-99.proof.4","euclid-10-99.proof.5","euclid-10-99.proof.6","euclid-10-99.proof.7","euclid-10-99.proof.8","euclid-10-99.proof.9","euclid-10-99.proof.10","euclid-10-99.proof.11","euclid-10-99.proof.12","euclid-10-99.proof.13","euclid-10-99.proof.14","euclid-10-99.proof.15","euclid-10-99.conclusion","euclid-10-99.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-99.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a432b00e3f253777100d10781c49c69b8132c8d5b757013b8270514b69a8d638","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The square on a second apotome of a medial straight line applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth a third apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"中项无理线段正方形截差无理线段的第二度,适用于有理线段生产的宽度为第三度截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e8518a621c87ef9c758460e3be3182163b45a245b80e4ada89d15ff254e7ac1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be a second apotome of a medial straight line, and CD rational, and to CD let there be applied CE equal to the square on AB, producing CF as breadth; I say that CF is a third apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是中项无理线段秒中的第二截差无理线段秒,CD 有理秒,CD秒,AB秒的CE秒等于正方形秒,宽度扩大CF秒;我说CF秒是第三个截差无理线段秒。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6774e095e81e99eb2e69b8c20e9e8051d47116f443baffb6db34bd6ead55c2a9","citations":["euclid-10-75"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BG be the annex to AB; therefore AG, GB are medial straight lines commensurable in square only which contain a medial rectangle. [[X. 75](/principles/euclid-10-75)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BG是AB的附件;因此,AG,GB是中项无理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度,包含中项无理线段,矩形。 [[X. 75](/principles/euclid-10-75)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"65de62d30a7bfb2471d5690295d7af0b0f5b97d2aadff11e91cea6497a876d4c","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let CH equal to the square on AG be applied to CD, producing CK as breadth, and let KL equal to the square on BG be applied to KH, producing KM as breadth; therefore the whole CL is equal to the squares on AG, GB; therefore CL is also medial. [[X. 15 and 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CH等于AG时正方形分适用于CD,宽度扩大为CK,KL等于BG时正方形,宽度扩大为KH,宽度扩大为KM,因此,整个CL等于AG,AG,GB,因此,CL也等于中项无理线段。 [[X. 15 and 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1dbe2585cb12021da756cd4fab93bfa8325b874e66a99b95c3224f1f6d5993c6","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line CD, producing CM as breadth; therefore CM is rational and incommensurable in length with CD. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围扩大到CM宽,因此,CM长为有理,不可公度长为CD。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"504fc63c81e5ed5c8387088603464ad1fa0aeb6f308893839f6bc94ccb9e720e","citations":["euclid-2-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the whole CL is equal to the squares on AG, GB, and, in these, CE is equal to the square on AB, therefore the remainder LF is equal to twice the rectangle AG, GB. [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于整个CL等于AG,GB,其中CE等于正方形,AB,因此其余LF等于矩形,AG,GB的两倍。 [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":6,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"346a4006da7b75babee3c92415cfc43c0ae67abae6a7d8b6d9a9e8cb9137b84f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then FM be bisected at the point N, and let NO be drawn parallel to CD; therefore each of the rectangles FO, NL is equal to the rectangle AG, GB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FM在N线上被分成两部分,NO与CD线平行,因此矩形FONL每件等于矩形AGGB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"185752497410eb21e3fa0533bbdddadca76b106e64ebeb93ecf9a6d80ab251c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the rectangle AG, GB is medial; therefore FL is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是矩形 AG,GB是中项无理线段,因此FL也是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ffb65901e7facbfbcf3d5aaaeffc5f444ce0fc19629b966295f845c0ee0da080","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line EF, producing FM as breadth; therefore FM is also rational and incommensurable in length with CD. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围扩大到FM宽,因此FM长有理和不可公度长CD。（相关点与线段：EF） [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f76e10474c644c7a87b25acd7da3262cc3cfd0402ae1e802f2b47e1e6f9a4757","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AG, GB are commensurable in square only, therefore AG is incommensurable in length with GB; therefore the square on AG is also incommensurable with the rectangle AG, GB. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AG,GB是平方可公度而长度不可公度,AG是不可公度,GB,AG也是不可公度,平方可公度而长度不可公度也是不可公度,矩形,AG,GB [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e211c1794efc891da6724c148583c48f39592003bfd40f2d30043819adc5433","citations":["euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the squares on AG, GB are commensurable with the square on AG, and twice the rectangle AG, GB with the rectangle AG, GB; therefore the squares on AG, GB are incommensurable with twice the rectangle AG, GB. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AG,GB的正方形是可公度,AG是正方形,矩形,AG,GB是矩形,AG的两倍,GB是矩形,AG,GB;因此,AG,GB的正方形是不可公度,不可公度,矩形,AG是2倍。 [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b35ee556035976533d032f3dff557329b3a843941ba19bae03a88abbc4dafa27","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CL is equal to the squares on AG, GB, and FL is equal to twice the rectangle AG, GB; therefore CL is also incommensurable with FL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CL等于AG,GB的正方形,GB,FL等于矩形,AG,GB的两倍,因此CL也等于不可公度,FL。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c9705ddc987e2038c0c99aab170fb36ca66f335c37cc7cdad6560044081a0698","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as CL is to FL, so is CM to FM; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore CM is incommensurable in length with FM. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CL比FL等于CM比FM,因此,CM比CL等于FM；CL 与 FL 之比等于 CM 与 FM 之比；上述对应量不可公度。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e9689d66c63909b8fca33480f6a6e8446452b520ecf2c95b52eb0af220454a2f","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational; therefore CM, MF are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore CF is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者均为有理;因此,CM,MF是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,CF是截差无理线段。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"68a9d7d756e73183d9604fcc8f6742a2605b9382ccb6e5f2a9f8ba6e4d38749f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also a third apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是第三个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"139d2f4085bec37f989b28d44f3a883c839091e8535be8c4cfa0b19d5563dda5","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the square on AG is commensurable with the square on GB, therefore CH is also commensurable with KL, so that CK is also commensurable with KM. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AG正方形可公度正方形GBGBGBGBKLCHAGCK可公度KM [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a04c6a1c5a6085208007eab7a9bf6707ac3978c7e774f576127bc3518f05857e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the rectangle AG, GB is a mean proportional between the squares on AG, GB, and CH is equal to the square on AG, KL equal to the square on GB, and NL equal to the rectangle AG, GB, therefore NL is also a mean proportional between CH, KL; therefore, as CH is to NL, so is NL to KL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为以 AG、GB 为边的矩形面积是 AG 的平方与 GB 的平方之间的比例中项，而 CH 等于 AG 的平方，KL 等于 GB 的平方，NL 等于以 AG、GB 为边的矩形面积，所以 NL 也是 CH 与 KL 之间的比例中项；因此，CH 与 NL 之比等于 NL 与 KL 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"757ecc6cdda35ba8efb9cdbb3074692d1f1aa33848920354269d4044ca1a176b","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as CH is to NL, so is CK to NM, and, as NL is to KL, so is NM to KM; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore, as CK is to MN, so is MN to KM; [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] therefore the rectangle CK, KM is equal to [the square on MN, that is, to] the fourth part of the square on FM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CH-NL的比等于CK-NM的比,NL-KL的比等于NM-KM的比;因此,CK-MN的比等于MN-KM的比;因此,矩形 CK、KM的比等于[MN的正方形,即FM的正方形的4 ,即]正方形的的4/4；CH 与 NL 之比等于 CK 与 NM 之比；NL 与 KL 之比等于 NM 与 KM 之比；CK 与 MN 之比等于 MN 与 KM 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"08e4e943e6d7513011f02baf087b7e208c5cedcc17ee602e1234b0d0db2b8132","citations":["euclid-10-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then CM, MF are two unequal straight lines, and a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on FM and deficient by a square figure has been applied to CM, and divides it into commensurable parts, therefore the square on CM is greater than the square on MF by the square on a straight line commensurable with CM. [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那以后,CM,MF是两条不平等的直线,平行四边形相当于FM正方形的第四部分,有正方形不足的数字被应用于CM,分为可公度,因此,CM正方形比MF正方形大,比正方形可公度和CM直线的正方形大。 [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f2cdfd7a976adade74a1c7757c7ab8dd82bbd98fa1c9922bdc8c0e3dc366dc84","citations":["euclid-10-def-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And neither of the straight lines CM, MF is commensurable in length with the rational straight line CD set out; therefore CF is a third apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CM线,MF线, 都没有长度可公度,有理线段CD线已经确定, 所以CF线是第三个截差无理线段。 [[X. Deff. III. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":20,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-99.source","contentId":"euclid-10-99","revisionId":"euclid-10-99@raw-09f69d540c778e71","order":21,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec307e4005bcae9e5